# cuts/v1.0.44/cut.env -- the pins this cut is made from.
#
# WHY v1.0.44 EXISTS: v1.0.43 COULD NOT INSTALL. It aborted every attempt at
# 19%, step fda_extract, on an artefact that verified clean for signature,
# staple, hash and embedded version. Walked on hardware 2026-08-24; see
# cuts/DEFECTS_ROLLFORWARD.md, WALKS row v1.0.43, findings v1043-D001..D003.
#
# CM051 names the tree whose install.sh SHIPS, compared by BLOB IDENTITY and
# not by ancestry. 2fb63f73 is main at the moment this cut record was written. It carries
# #1013's guard fix AND #1015, which scoped that fix's second layer per
# DIRECTORY after ORM demonstrated that the per-NAME form could be defeated by
# one empty file. The PR that adds this
# file touches Info.plist, project.yml, cuts/ and cut-manifests/ -- NOT
# install.sh -- so the blob it names is the blob that ships.
#
# DAEMON_COMMIT is UNCHANGED from v1.0.43. This is an installer-only recut of a
# dead installer; moving the daemon pin would put unrelated change into a
# blocker fix, and the daemon lane has not moved.
CUT_VERSION=1.0.44
DAEMON_COMMIT=1b0a5013525a
CM051=2fb63f73f0ddeec3f415bbc92c64ca227142f613
